0..62 Comment "// This source measures model resolution with many candidates."
63..65 Comment "//"
66..126 Comment "// Sixteen `Count` models each provide one distinct carrier."
127..129 Comment "//"
130..208 Comment "// The checker resolves `advanced` once for each carrier. It tries each of the"
209..285 Comment "// sixteen candidates at each of the sixteen slots, against one solver store"
286..319 Comment "// that holds all of their holes."
320..322 Comment "//"
323..338 Comment "// - see: #2395"
